# mtk/mt6768/drivers/wifi/conf: CONNSYS, the MT6768's Wi-Fi and Bluetooth subsystem.
# CONFIG_HAKIOS_<NAME>=y in a defconfig builds a driver into the kernel (docs/drivers-config.md). MediaTek's drivers are
# `default n`: a configuration has them only when it includes mt6768.config.

driver MTK_CONNSYS
	file    bsd/dev/hakios.mtk_connsys.c
	default n
	help    CONNSYS step by step (connsys_step=N): its power, its firmware into its memory (/fw/connsys/ of the root, from
	help    the phone: fw-connsys/), BTIF, STP and the WMT command channel (connsys_step=8). No network yet
